 12-month low, down about $1.9bn from June.","src":[]},{"text":"The current account surplus was 7.9% of GDP in 2025, supported by historically high gold prices. That is a concentration risk to flag.","src":[]}]},"fiscal":{"as_of":"2026-09-22","points":[{"text":"IMF staff see lowering the primary surplus to 0.5% of GDP from 2027 as consistent with debt sustainability.","src":["IMF"]}]},"debt":{"as_of":"2026-09-22","points":[{"text":"The IMF completed the final ECF review, and Ghana's risk of debt distress was upgraded to moderate, two years earlier than expected.","src":["IMF"]},{"text":"IMF engagement is moving to a non-financing PCI.","src":["IMF"]}]},"valuation":{"as_of":null,"points":[{"text":"Add the post-restructuring Eurobond yields to the bonds list.","src":[]}]},"catalysts":{"as_of":"2026-09-22","points":[{"text":"Watch the PCI approval, gold prices and whether BoG cuts given inflation below the target band.","src":[]}]}},"narrative_pending":false,"derived":{"interest":{},"policy_source":"Bank of Ghana","policy_rate":["2026-09-22",14.0],"real_rate":-0.21,"fx_changes":{"1w":1.03,"1m":3.72,"3m":2.99,"1y":-6.24,"ytd":7.52},"auto":{"macro":["World Bank real GDP growth: 6.0% in 2025 (IMF WEO unavailable on this run).","World Bank CPI inflation: 14.2% in 2025 (IMF WEO unavailable on this run).","Policy rate 14.00% (2026-09-22); real rate ≈ -0.2% against World Bank 2025 CPI inflation of 14.2%."],"external":["World Bank current account (% GDP): 8.2% in 2025 (IMF WEO unavailable on this run).","USD/GHS 11.7200 on 2026-10-02, GHS weaker by 3.7% over 1m; +7.5% YTD.","Reserves $4.5bn at end-2024 (World Bank), 1.6 months of imports."],"fiscal":[],"debt":["External debt $37.4bn at end-2024 (World Bank IDS); debt service 9% of exports (2024).","Central government interest payments: 22% of revenue (2023, World Bank)."],"valuation":[],"catalysts":["8 headlines in the last 14 days (below)."]}},"windows_stale":{"macro":false,"external":false,"fiscal":false,"debt":false,"valuat